## UI Craft: Sticky Section Sub-Bar

**Stack:** css-handoff · **Theme:** light + dark · **States:** complete (R-ui-craft-15)

---

### Tokens & Architecture

| Token | Light | Dark |
|---|---|---|
| `--subnav-bg` → `--glass-bg` | 74% surface + blur | 78% surface + blur |
| `--surface-2` | `#f4f4f5` (pill fill) | `#1c1c22` |
| `--fg` | `#09090b` | `#fafafa` |
| `--muted` | `#52525b` ≥ 7:1 | `#a1a1aa` ≥ 7.5:1 |
| `--line` | `#e4e4e7` | `#27272a` |
| `--focus` | `#2563eb` | `#60a5fa` |
| `--z-sticky` | `20` | `20` |

**Layout:** `position: sticky; top: 0` — bar scrolls with page then locks. Pill slides via `--_pill-left` / `--_pill-width` on `.subnav-track` (set by engineering JS, animated by CSS). Scroll-margin offsets on anchors keep headings clear.

---

### CSS — `section-subnav.css`

```css
/* ===================================================
   section-subnav.css
   UX_DESIGNER output — css-handoff mode
   Engineering wires markup per contract below.
   =================================================== */

/* ── 1. Token Supplement ───────────────────────────── */
:root {
  --bg:             #ffffff;
  --surface:        #fafafa;
  --surface-2:      #f4f4f5;
  --glass-bg:       color-mix(in srgb, var(--surface) 74%, transparent);
  --fg:             #09090b;
  --muted:          #52525b;
  --line:           #e4e4e7;
  --line-strong:    #a1a1aa;
  --accent:         #18181b;
  --fg-on-accent:   #ffffff;
  --focus:          #2563eb;
  --shadow-sm:      0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
  --shadow-md:      0 8px 24px -8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
  --r-xs:  4px;
  --r-sm:  6px;
  --r-md:  10px;
  --r-lg:  14px;
  --r-xl:  16px;
  --z-sticky:    20;
  --z-dropdown:  40;
  --z-command:   60;
  --z-modal:     80;
  --z-toast:     100;

  /* sub-bar locals */
  --_subnav-h:        48px;
  --_subnav-pad-x:    4px;
  --_tab-pad-x:       16px;
  --_tab-pad-y:       6px;
  --_pill-left:       0px;
  --_pill-width:      80px;
}

:root[data-theme="dark"] {
  --bg:             #09090b;
  --surface:        #121216;
  --surface-2:      #1c1c22;
  --glass-bg:       color-mix(in srgb, var(--surface) 78%, transparent);
  --fg:             #fafafa;
  --muted:          #a1a1aa;
  --line:           #27272a;
  --line-strong:    #52525b;
  --accent:         #fafafa;
  --fg-on-accent:   #09090b;
  --focus:          #60a5fa;
  --shadow-md:      0 10px 28px -8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55);
}

@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  :root:not([data-theme="light"]) {
    --bg:             #09090b;
    --surface:        #121216;
    --surface-2:      #1c1c22;
    --glass-bg:       color-mix(in srgb, var(--surface) 78%, transparent);
    --fg:             #fafafa;
    --muted:          #a1a1aa;
    --line:           #27272a;
    --line-strong:    #52525b;
    --accent:         #fafafa;
    --fg-on-accent:   #09090b;
    --focus:          #60a5fa;
    --shadow-md:      0 10px 28px -8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55);
  }
}


/* ── 2. Bar Shell ──────────────────────────────────── */
.section-subnav {
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
  z-index: var(--z-sticky);
  width: 100%;
  /* Opaque fallback — text always legible */
  background: var(--surface);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  transition: box-shadow 160ms ease;
}

/* Glass upgrade when backdrop-filter is supported */
@supports (backdrop-filter: blur(20px)) {
  .section-subnav {
    background: var(--glass-bg);
    backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(1.4);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(1.4);
  }
}

/* Elevated shadow once user has scrolled (JS adds [data-scrolled]) */
.section-subnav[data-scrolled="true"] {
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
}

/* Inner centering wrapper — prevents overflow on wide viewports */
.subnav-inner {
  max-width: 1120px;
  margin-inline: auto;
  padding-inline: 16px;
  height: var(--_subnav-h);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  overflow-x: auto;
  overflow-y: visible;
  scrollbar-width: none;        /* Firefox */
}
.subnav-inner::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }


/* ── 3. Tab Track & Sliding Pill ───────────────────── */
.subnav-track {
  position: relative;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 2px;
  padding: var(--_subnav-pad-x);
  min-width: max-content;       /* prevents wrap on small screens */

  /* JS writes these two custom properties; CSS animates them */
  --_pill-left:  0px;
  --_pill-width: 80px;
}

/* The sliding pill — sits behind all tabs at z-index 0 */
.subnav-indicator {
  position: absolute;
  top: 50%;
  left: var(--_pill-left);
  width: var(--_pill-width);
  height: calc(100% - 8px);
  transform: translateY(-50%);
  background: var(--surface-2);
  border-radius: var(--r-sm);
  z-index: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
  /* GPU-friendly — only transform + width change */
  transition:
    left  200ms cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1),
    width 200ms cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
  will-change: left, width;
}

/* Disable spatial slide under reduced-motion;
   keep the fill so active state is still clear */
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  .subnav-indicator {
    transition: none;
  }
}


/* ── 4. Tab Buttons ────────────────────────────────── */
.subnav-tab {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;                   /* sits above the pill */
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 6px;
  min-height: 44px;             /* R-ui-craft-6: touch target */
  padding: var(--_tab-pad-y) var(--_tab-pad-x);
  border: none;
  background: transparent;
  border-radius: var(--r-sm);
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 500;
  line-height: 1.5;
  color: var(--muted);
  white-space: nowrap;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition:
    color  120ms ease,
    opacity 120ms ease;
}

/* ── 4a. Hover ─────────────────────────────────────── */
.subnav-tab:hover:not([aria-selected="true"]):not([aria-disabled="true"]) {
  color: var(--fg);
}

/* ── 4b. Focus-visible (keyboard) ─────────────────── */
.subnav-tab:focus-visible {
  outline: 2px solid var(--focus);
  outline-offset: 2px;
  border-radius: var(--r-sm);
}

/* ── 4c. Active / Selected ─────────────────────────── */
.subnav-tab[aria-selected="true"] {
  color: var(--fg);
  font-weight: 600;
  cursor: default;
}

/* Active press tactile feedback */
.subnav-tab:active:not([aria-disabled="true"]) {
  transform: scale(0.97);
  transition: transform 80ms ease;
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  .subnav-tab:active {
    transform: none;
  }
}

/* ── 4d. Disabled ──────────────────────────────────── */
.subnav-tab[aria-disabled="true"] {
  opacity: 0.45;
  cursor: not-allowed;
  pointer-events: none;
}


/* ── 5. Badge / Count inside a tab ────────────────── */
.subnav-tab-badge {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  min-width: 20px;
  height: 18px;
  padding-inline: 5px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: var(--line);
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 600;
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; /* R-ui-craft-4 */
  line-height: 1;
  transition: background 160ms ease, color 160ms ease;
}

.subnav-tab[aria-selected="true"] .subnav-tab-badge {
  background: var(--accent);
  color: var(--fg-on-accent);
}


/* ── 6. Loading skeleton state ─────────────────────── */
/* Applied when [aria-busy="true"] on .section-subnav.
   Tabs are replaced by fixed-width ghost blocks.    */
.section-subnav[aria-busy="true"] .subnav-tab {
  visibility: hidden;           /* preserve layout width */
  pointer-events: none;
}

.section-subnav[aria-busy="true"] .subnav-track::after {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  inset: 6px 4px;
  border-radius: var(--r-sm);
  background: linear-gradient(
    90deg,
    var(--line)         25%,
    var(--surface-2)    50%,
    var(--line)         75%
  );
  background-size: 200% 100%;
  animation: subnav-shimmer 1.4s ease infinite;
}

@keyframes subnav-shimmer {
  from { background-position: 200% 0; }
  to   { background-position: -200% 0; }
}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  .section-subnav[aria-busy="true"] .subnav-track::after {
    animation: none;
    opacity: 0.5;
  }
}


/* ── 7. Section anchor offset ──────────────────────── */
/* Prevents the sticky bar from obscuring jump targets */
[data-subnav-anchor] {
  scroll-margin-top: calc(var(--_subnav-h) + 24px);
}


/* ── 8. Responsive: 390px mobile ─────────────────────
   Track stays horizontally scrollable; bar never
   causes horizontal page overflow (R-ui-craft-8).  */
@media (max-width: 767px) {
  .subnav-inner {
    padding-inline: 12px;
  }

  .subnav-tab {
    font-size: 13px;
    padding-inline: 12px;
  }
}
```

---

### Markup Handoff Contract

Engineering receives this contract to wire HTML, ARIA, and JS exactly.

#### Required DOM shape

```html
<nav class="section-subnav"
     aria-label="Section navigation"
     data-scrolled="false">          <!-- JS toggles to "true" past 8px scroll -->

  <div class="subnav-inner">
    <div class="subnav-track"
         role="tablist"
         aria-label="Section navigation">

      <!-- Animated pill — purely visual; JS moves it -->
      <div class="subnav-indicator" aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <!-- One .subnav-tab per section.
           aria-selected="true" on the active one only. -->
      <button class="subnav-tab"
              role="tab"
              aria-selected="true"
              aria-controls="panel-overview"
              id="tab-overview">
        Overview
      </button>

      <button class="subnav-tab"
              role="tab"
              aria-selected="false"
              aria-controls="panel-features"
              id="tab-features">
        Features
        <!-- Optional badge -->
        <span class="subnav-tab-badge" aria-label="3 new">3</span>
      </button>

      <button class="subnav-tab"
              role="tab"
              aria-selected="false"
              aria-controls="panel-pricing"
              id="tab-pricing">
        Pricing
      </button>

      <!-- Disabled example -->
      <button class="subnav-tab"
              role="tab"
              aria-selected="false"
              aria-disabled="true"
              id="tab-changelog">
        Changelog
      </button>

    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<!-- Sections — each anchored for scroll-nav -->
<section id="panel-overview"
         role="tabpanel"
         aria-labelledby="tab-overview"
         data-subnav-anchor>
  <!-- content -->
</section>
```

#### JS wiring engineering must provide

**1. Pill position updater** — call after `click`, `keydown`, and on first paint:

```js
function updatePill(activeTab) {
  const track = activeTab.closest('.subnav-track');
  const trackRect = track.getBoundingClientRect();
  const tabRect   = activeTab.getBoundingClientRect();
  track.style.setProperty('--_pill-left',  `${tabRect.left - trackRect.left}px`);
  track.style.setProperty('--_pill-width', `${tabRect.width}px`);
}
```

CSS handles the smooth transition; no JS animation needed.

**2. Scroll shadow** — toggle `data-scrolled` on the bar:

```js
const bar = document.querySelector('.section-subnav');
window.addEventListener('scroll', () => {
  bar.dataset.scrolled = window.scrollY > 8 ? 'true' : 'false';
}, { passive: true });
```

**3. Keyboard navigation** — on `.subnav-track`:

| Key | Action |
|---|---|
| `ArrowLeft` / `ArrowRight` | Move `aria-selected` to prev / next tab; call `updatePill` |
| `Home` / `End` | Jump to first / last tab |
| `Tab` | Move browser focus out of the tab list |

**4. Loading state** — set `aria-busy="true"` on `.section-subnav` while data loads; remove it and restore `aria-selected` when ready.

**5. Anchor offset** — add `data-subnav-anchor` to every `<section>` target; CSS handles `scroll-margin-top`.

---

### Interactive States & Keyboard Contract

| State | CSS trigger | Visible change |
|---|---|---|
| Default | — | Muted label, transparent background |
| Hover | `:hover` | Label shifts to `--fg` |
| Focus-visible | `:focus-visible` | `2px var(--focus)` outline, offset 2px |
| Active / selected | `[aria-selected="true"]` | Pill slides under tab, label `--fg` + weight 600 |
| Active press | `:active` | `scale(0.97)` for 80ms |
| Disabled | `[aria-disabled="true"]` | 45% opacity, no pointer events |
| Loading | `[aria-busy="true"]` on bar | Shimmer gradient across track width, tabs hidden |
| Scrolled | `[data-scrolled="true"]` | Elevated `--shadow-md` on bar |

**Reduced-motion:** pill transition and active press transform are disabled; active state stays visible via color + weight only. Shimmer is static at 50% opacity.

