- `min-height: 44px` on every `.subnav-tab` — passes R-ui-craft-6
- `transform` + `opacity` only in animations — passes R-ui-craft-9
- `@media (prefers-reduced-motion)` present — passes R-ui-craft-9
- `scroll-margin-top` on anchors — passes R-ui-craft-8
- Overflow: `overflow-x: auto` on `.subnav-inner` + `min-width: max-content` on `.subnav-track` — prevents horizontal page bleed at 390px

